'''Astral Protection''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of five can be exchanged for a random [[Shaper item|Shaper-influenced]] [[normal]] [[shield]].

{{Item acquisition}}

===Trivia===

The artwork depicts [[The Shaper]], [[Zana]], and the [[Conquerors]] (including [[Sirus]]).

